<section class="pn-delivery" style="margin-top:20px"><h2>Automatic appointment checks</h2><p>Counseling appointments without recorded attendance become Missed on the following day. Entrance examinations become Missed / absent after the booked two-hour session ends. Attended sessions, recorded results, cancellations and sessions in progress are preserved.</p><p>Last appointment check: <strong><?=$mailE($appointmentRun?:'Not yet recorded')?></strong> (Philippine time).</p><p>The local Windows job checks every minute while this user is signed in and XAMPP is running. When hosted online, configure the appointment worker and email worker as scheduled server jobs.</p></section>
